previously adapted into the 2012 live-action film Diary of a Wimpy Kid: Dog Days.

14
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:46,000
The film was announced in July 2025 alongside its sequel The Getaway
(2026), and was released on Disney+ on December 5, 2025.

